# HARD data budget (project mirror)

Follow `~/.cursor/rules/hard-data-budget.mdc` and user hooks in `~/.cursor/hooks.json`.

- ≤4 tool calls/turn; no Task/subagents; no unbounded Glob
- No push/gh/CI/CDP/MCP unless current message explicitly asks
- Hard timeouts on ADB/shell; kill hangs; no leftover watchers
- After chat: hooks kill crawls; user must **Quit Cursor** (`~/.cursor/bin/cursor-quit-data.sh` or Cmd+Q) to stop idle `api*`/`repo42`
